  "contentHtml": "<p>여러 해 ...앙금 생성 반응 실험을..</p><p>코팅판 위에 반응시키고...휴지로 닦아내는 방식으로 했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>단점&#160; 1. 사용 후 코팅판을 박박 닦아내지 않으면....다음 반 실험 결과가 잘못 나온다.</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2. 용액을 많이 떨어뜨리면 옆 칸에 막 번진다.</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 3. 휴지 사용량 + 물티슈 사용량이 많다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이번에...&#39; 일회용 홈판&#39; 을 알게되어 사용해봤는데요..</p><p>위의 단점이 보완 되면서 만족스러워 소개합니다.</p><p>실험 후 휴지로 닦지 않고 그대로 모았다가 폐기물처리~~</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/09aeb3a7bceb03dfa03945eacdaeac7dedd9b61f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"375\" height=\"211\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/09aeb3a7bceb03dfa03945eacdaeac7dedd9b61f\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"><div class=\"figcaption\">10개입(약5천원) 으로 판매, 반 잘라서 쓰면 20개조 실험가능,</div></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c7bb1e383a937fe9780ebcf42109fa99d39d666\" data-origin-width=\"1279\" data-origin-height=\"721\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c7bb1e383a937fe9780ebcf42109fa99d39d666\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ccb03dd794fa515f48d188e6eded3fbb6bbbb3a1\" data-origin-width=\"1279\" data-origin-height=\"721\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ccb03dd794fa515f48d188e6eded3fbb6bbbb3a1\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cd4834f0850af27b1cea67697ea165b6ffeecd9d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cd4834f0850af27b1cea67697ea165b6ffeecd9d\" data-origin-width=\"1097\" data-origin-height=\"477\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e11afc3fd8f397ec2c471caea1f964d65bcf2c9?download\" data-file-name=\"앙금 생성 반응판.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"36243\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D242%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20240409161355&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F6e11afc3fd8f397ec2c471caea1f964d65bcf2c9')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">앙금 생성 반응판</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">35.39KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
